# The sandbox's conditions switched on and off, each change a
# `SandboxConditions ...` line in the log (a scene script: chimera_client's
# `scene`): god, endless ammo, time scale, third person and its distance,
# frozen targets (a strafing one holds still).
#   cargo run --features dev --bin ultimate_gun_game -- --offscreen 1600x900 +volume 0 +sandbox \
#       --scene apps/ultimate_gun_game/scenes/conditions.scene --out <dir>
wait_for map_loaded 6000
wait_for spawned 3000
wait 120
setpos 0 -1181 0
setang 2 90
rung combat_arms:m4a1
target add combat_arms:m4a1 8 strafe
wait 120
sandbox conditions
sandbox god on
wait 10
sandbox god off
wait 10
sandbox ammo off
wait 10
sandbox ammo on
wait 10
sandbox timescale 0.5
wait 10
sandbox timescale 0.25
wait 10
sandbox timescale 1
wait 10
sandbox thirdperson on
sandbox camdist 120
wait 30
shot condition_thirdperson
sandbox thirdperson off
wait 10
sandbox freeze on
wait 60
shot condition_frozen_a
wait 90
shot condition_frozen_b
sandbox freeze off
wait 90
shot condition_unfrozen
sandbox conditions
wait 30
